ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-11-28T09:37:25Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T18:34:05Z","closed_at":"2024-12-15T18:53:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99782","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99782.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99782.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fix #98661 \r\n\r\nSeveral setters in the class `Material` do not call `notify_property_list_changed()`. Therefore, changes to some material properties will not be visible immediately in the viewport. To see the changes, the user has to unselect the node with the changed material and the reselect the node. \r\n\r\nThis pull request adds calls to `notify_property_list_changed()` to all setters which did not have such calls before and also to some helper methods used by several setters to set the properties. This makes changes to material properties immediately reflect in the editor viewport.\r\n\r\nBefore fix: changing cull mode for a material does not immediately change the cull mode in the editor viewport.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1af50884-df00-4799-b109-dc84420616f5\r\n\r\nAfter fix: changing cull mode immediately shows the change.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9116932a-ea1d-4ca2-ac5e-512b6594e850\r\n\r\nDo please take a look to see if I have missed some setter or helper method or if I have added an unnecessary call to `notify_property_list_changed()`. Thanks!\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"KingTheFifth","id":57488573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NDg4NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57488573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth","html_url":"https://github.com/KingTheFifth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KingTheFifth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99782/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}